 decrease and approach $-\\infty $, the graph of the function moves closer and closer to the horizontal asymptote $y=0.$ \n\nConsequently, $f(x)$ approaches the value $0$ as $x$ approaches $-\\infty ,$ and we have\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=0.\n$$\n\nOn the right side of the graph, as the values of $x$ increase and approach $\\infty ,$ the graph of the function grows without bound to $\\infty $ as well. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=\\infty .\n$$"] ["question-20650e5d-9531-58b0-8986-a410d28ac857" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-d514cf12-4a07-554b-a399-ec37796f1ec8" :answer-field/id #uuid "d514cf12-4a07-554b-a399-ec37796f1ec8"] ["answer-d3886d3c-89e6-5a05-8ffc-24fd67a5d7b2" :answer/id #uuid "d3886d3c-89e6-5a05-8ffc-24fd67a5d7b2"] ["answer-d3886d3c-89e6-5a05-8ffc-24fd67a5d7b2" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-d3886d3c-89e6-5a05-8ffc-24fd67a5d7b2" :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=0$"] ["answer-3c61804f-0426-5bd0-879c-10e37f3d6812" :answer/id #uuid "3c61804f-0426-5bd0-879c-10e37f3d6812"] ["answer-3c61804f-0426-5bd0-879c-10e37f3d6812" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-3c61804f-0426-5bd0-879c-10e37f3d6812" :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=\\infty $"] ["answer-609c690a-1985-5867-88ea-6530c846e51c" :answer/id #uuid "609c690a-1985-5867-88ea-6530c846e51c"] ["answer-609c690a-1985-5867-88ea-6530c846e51c" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-609c690a-1985-5867-88ea-6530c846e51c" :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=0$ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=\\infty $"] ["answer-81c2b701-5db9-575d-9e08-953094b78ec5" :answer/id #uuid "81c2b701-5db9-575d-9e08-953094b78ec5"] ["answer-81c2b701-5db9-575d-9e08-953094b78ec5" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-81c2b701-5db9-575d-9e08-953094b78ec5" :answer/value "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x)=\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }f(x)=-\\infty $"] ["answer-4